<name>Engine Control</name>
<ttl id="10006_S000J_74XSN_T00GF" variety="T00GF">
<name>Camshaft Timing Oil Control Valve Assembly (2GR-FE)</name>
<para id="RM0000020UV00BX" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="066PR-00" from="200708">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM0000020UV00BX_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM0000020UV00BX_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000F5D00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Camshaft Timing Oil Control Valve Assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A128933" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Measurement Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1 - 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>20°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>6.9 to7.9Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Operation Check</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Apply battery voltage between the terminals and check that the spool valve operates.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A149391J03" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Check that the spool valve is not stuck.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Poor return of the spool valve caused by foreign matter such as sludge being caught in it results in a slight pressure leak to the advance side, which may cause a DTC to be detected.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
